yields showed little movement on Thursday, coinciding with steady oil prices. Recent U.S. inflation data has lessened the market's anticipation of a Federal Reserve rate increase in the upcoming month. With energy dialogues taking place and the potential reopening of the Strait of Hormuz, investors are on alert. Rising oil prices could lead to continued interest rate hikes by the ECB.\n\nBank of Baroda is actively seeking dollar funding avenues to bolster its operations, inspired by the successful foreign-currency bond issuance led by State Bank of India. The bank is considering a dual-tranche bond sale with maturities of three and five years. Indian banks are keen on dollar bor", "citation": "Euro zone bonds little changed as oil prices steady \u2014 ET Markets, 2026-08-13. https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/bonds/euro-zone-bonds-little-changed-as-oil-prices-steady/articleshow/133203702.cms"}], "primary_sources": [{"series": "usd_mxn", "name": "Yahoo \u00b7 MXN=X", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/MXN=X"}, {"series": "aud_usd", "name": "Yahoo \u00b7 AUDUSD=X", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AUDUSD=X"}, {"series": "gbp_usd", "name": "Yahoo \u00b7 GBPUSD=X", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GBPUSD=X"}, {"series": "eur_usd", "name": "Yahoo \u00b7 EURUSD=X", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/EURUSD=X"}], "analogues": {"member_z_today": {"usd_mxn": 0.92, "aud_usd": -0.28, "gbp_usd": 1.25, "eur_usd": -0.25}, "analogues": [{"date": "2026-07-10", "distance": 0.0, "member_z": {"usd_mxn": 0.92, "aud_usd": -0.28, "gbp_usd": 1.25, "eur_usd": -0.25}}, {"date": "2025-08-15", "distance": 0.23, "member_z": {"usd_mxn": 1.04, "aud_usd": -0.44, "gbp_usd": 1.15, "eur_usd": 0.17}}, {"date": "2025-03-31", "distance": 0.52, "member_z": {"usd_mxn": 0.77, "aud_usd": -0.51, "gbp_usd": 0.36, "eur_usd": 0.2}}, {"date": "2025-01-31", "distance": 0.52, "member_z": {"usd_mxn": 0.91, "aud_usd": -0.44, "gbp_usd": 0.77, "eur_usd": 0.66}}, {"date": "2026-05-05"