olutions among 7 stocks hitting 52-week highs; surge up to 20% in a month \u2014 ET Markets, 2026-08-13. https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/lenskart-solutions-among-7-stocks-hitting-52-week-highs-surge-up-to-20-in-a-month/slideshow/133210592.cms"}, {"title": "Lenskart shares soar after strong Q1 results and MSCI inclusion buzz", "feed": "BusinessLine Mkts", "ts": "2026-08-13T11:09:02+00:00", "url": "https://www.thehindubusinessline.com/markets/lenskart-shares-zoom-nearly-7-to-fresh-52-week-high-after-strong-q1-results-and-msci-inclusion-buzz/article71339607.ece", "status": "ok", "excerpt": "Lenskart Solutions shares closed with nearly 2 per cent gains on Thursday, after the eyewear retailer reported a multifold surge in consolidated net profit for the April-June period.\n\nThe stock closed 1.78 per cent positive at \u20b9596.90 on the NSE after hitting a 52-week high of \u20b9626.95, against the previous close of \u20b9586.45.\n\nLenskart posted consolidated net profit of \u20b9221.84 crore in the April-June period. Revenue from operations grew 43.3 per cent to \u20b92,714.18 crore. Revenue from the India segment grew 30.7 per cent to \u20b91,531 crore, while international revenue rose 38 per cent to \u20b91,203 crore.\n\nThe eyewear retailer\u2019s board approved increasing its equity stake in Chinese frame-manufacturing ", "citation": "Lenskart shares soar after strong Q1 results and MSCI inclusion buzz \u2014 BusinessLine Mkts, 2026-08-13. https://www.thehindubusinessline.com/markets/lenskart-shares-zoom-nearly-7-to-fresh-52-week-high-after-strong-q1-results-and-msci-inclusion-buzz/article71339607.ece"}, {"title": "Lenskart shares hit record high after Q1 profit jumps nearly four-fold; Motilal Oswal lifts target price", "feed": "Mint Markets", "ts": "2026-08-13T09:12:08+00:00", "url": "https://www.livemint.com/market/stock-market-news/lenskart-shares-hit-record-high-after-q1-profit-jumps-nearly-four-fold-motilal-oswal-lifts-target-price-11786610679031.html", "status": "ok", "excerpt": "Indian eyewear retailer Lenskart Solutions saw its shares gain 7% in Thursday\u2019s trade, August 13, to hit a fresh all-time high of \u20b9627 after the company sustained its growth momentum in the June quarter and reported a near four-fold jump in profit.\n\nThe company on Wednesday reported a net profit of \u20b9228 crore, compared with \u20b961 crore in the same period last year, marking a 273% year-on-year increase. The strong growth in profitability was supported by sustained demand for its prescription eyewear.\n\nRevenue from operations grew 43.3% YoY to \u20b92,714.18 crore, compared with \u20b91,894.46 crore in Q1 FY26. Revenue from the India business grew 30.7% YoY to \u20b91,531 crore, while international revenue inc", "citation": "Lenskart shares hit record high after Q1 profit jumps nearly four-fold; Motilal Oswal lifts target price \u2014 Mint Markets, 2026-08-13. https://www.livemint.com/market/stock-market-news/lenskart-shares-hit-record-high-after-q1-profit-jumps-nearly-four-fold-motilal-oswal-lifts-target-price-11786610679031.html"}], "primary_sources": [{"series": "dyn_lenskart_ns", "name": "Yahoo \u00b7 LENSKART.NS", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/LENSKART.NS"}], "analogues": {"member_z_today": {"dyn_lenskart_ns": 1.8}, "analogues": [{"date": "2026-07-10", "distance": 0.0, "member_z": {"dyn_lenskart_ns": 1.8}}, {"date": "2026-05-29", "distance": 0.13, "member_z": {"dyn_lenskart_ns": 1.67}}, {"date": "2025-12-24", "distance": 0.24, "member_z": {"dyn_lenskart_ns": 1.56}}, {"date": "2026-07-03", "distance": 0.8, "member_z": {"dyn_lenskart_ns": 2.61}}, {"date": "2026-01-02", "distance": 0.9, "member_z": {"dyn_lenskart_ns": 0.9}}], "aftermath": {"dyn_lenskart_ns": {"stats": {"+5d": {"n": 5, "median_pct": 0.13, "hit_rate_up": 0.6, "min_pct": -3.32, "max_pct": 2.0}, "+20d": {"n": 4, "median_pct": -0.68, "hit_rate_up": 0.5, "min_pct": -2.85, "max_pct": 7.32}}, "median_path": [0.0, -0.83, 0.07, 0.23